  "title": "<is-tree>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "description": "Documentación y demos de is-tree / is-tree-item de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-tree",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-tree>",
      "lede": "Árbol jerárquico accesible: expansión, selección, navegación por teclado\r\n          (↑/↓/←/→/Home/End/Enter/Space), iconos por slot y selección\r\n          <code class=\"code\">single</code> | <code class=\"code\">leaf</code> | <code class=\"code\">multiple</code> | <code class=\"code\">none</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-tree id=\"tree1\" selection=\"single\" expanded>\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Documentos\r\n              <is-tree-item>\r\n                <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:file-document\"></is-icon>\r\n                facturas-2024.pdf\r\n              </is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>\r\n                <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:file-document\"></is-icon>\r\n                contratos.odt\r\n              </is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Proyectos\r\n              <is-tree-item>\r\n                <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n                ContaPyme\r\n                <is-tree-item>\r\n                  <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:language-typescript\"></is-icon>\r\n                  app.ts\r\n                </is-tree-item>\r\n                <is-tree-item>\r\n                  <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:language-css3\"></is-icon>\r\n                  styles.css\r\n                </is-tree-item>\r\n              </is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>\r\n                <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n                InSoft\r\n                <is-tree-item>\r\n                  <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:react\"></is-icon>\r\n                  index.jsx\r\n                </is-tree-item>\r\n              </is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:image\"></is-icon>\r\n              Capturas\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n          </is-tree>\r\n          <p id=\"tree1Log\" class=\"lede\">Seleccionado: <code class=\"code\">—</code></p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<is-tree selection=\"single\" expanded>\n  <is-tree-item>\n    <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\n    Documentos\n    <is-tree-item>facturas-2024.pdf</is-tree-item>\n  </is-tree-item>\n</is-tree>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "multiple",
      "title": "Selección múltiple",
      "lede": "Con <code class=\"code\">selection=\"multiple\"</code> cada nodo tiene su checkbox.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-tree id=\"tree2\" selection=\"multiple\">\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Backend\r\n              <is-tree-item>Python</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>Node.js</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>Go</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Frontend\r\n              <is-tree-item>React</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>Vue</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>Svelte</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n          </is-tree>\r\n          <p id=\"tree2Log\" class=\"lede\">Seleccionados: <code class=\"code\">—</code></p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf",
      "title": "Selección solo-leaf",
      "lede": "Con <code class=\"code\">selection=\"leaf\"</code> las carpetas no se pueden seleccionar.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-tree id=\"tree3\" selection=\"leaf\">\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder-account\"></is-icon>\r\n              Usuarios\r\n              <is-tree-item>admin</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>jperez</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>mlopez</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder-account\"></is-icon>\r\n              Invitados\r\n              <is-tree-item>guest</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n          </is-tree>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "none",
      "title": "Sin selección",
      "lede": "Con <code class=\"code\">selection=\"none\"</code> solo expande/colapsa.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-tree id=\"tree4\" selection=\"none\">\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Sólo expansión\r\n              <is-tree-item>uno</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item>dos</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n          </is-tree>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "disabled",
      "title": "Disabled",
      "lede": "El atributo <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> bloquea interacción.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-tree selection=\"single\">\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Producción\r\n              <is-tree-item disabled>db-master</is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-tree-item disabled>db-replica</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n            <is-tree-item>\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:folder\"></is-icon>\r\n              Staging\r\n              <is-tree-item>db-1</is-tree-item>\r\n            </is-tree-item>\r\n          </is-tree>"
        }
      ]
    },
